ponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":6,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Least"},"2":{"Display":"Most"}},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><em>Now, you will read about what Carl decided to do.<\/em><br>\n<br>Carl asks to check the knife.<br>\n<br>\nIn Carl's situation:<\/span><\/span>","DataExportTag":"C1-S8-AR","QuestionID":"QID756"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7WAUs8h39ApcuMe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID757","SecondaryAttribute":"When his sister finds out her ring is missing, she is very disappointed and decides to cancel the...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">When his sister finds out her ring is missing, she is very disappointed and decides to cancel the wedding.<\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><em>Please rate how much you agree with the following statement:<\/em><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n&nbsp;\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;Daniel should be blamed for the wedding being cancelled.&quot;<\/strong><\/span><\/span>&nbsp;<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":0,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":10,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":false,"CustomStart":false,"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":false},"QuestionDescription":"When his sister finds out her ring is missing, she is very disappointed and decides to cancel the...","Choices":{"4":{"Display":"&nbsp;"}},"ChoiceOrder":["4"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":7,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><em>Completely<br \/>\ndisagree<\/em><\/span><br \/>\n&nbsp;"},"2":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><em>Completely<br \/>\nagree<\/em><\/span><br \/>\n&nbsp;"}},"QuestionJS":false,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">The airport security becomes suspicious of Carl, so they take him in custody and he ends up missing the festival and cannot support his colleagues.<\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><em>Please rate how much you agree with the following statement:<\/em><\/span><\/span><br>\n&nbsp;\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"Carl should be blamed for missing the festival.\"<\/strong><\/span><\/span>&nbsp;<\/div>","DataExportTag":"C1-S8-B","QuestionID":"QID757"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7WAUs8h39ApcuMe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID758","SecondaryAttribute":"Please read the following scenario:\u00a0 \u00a0 Jeff works the night shift at a 24\/7 convenience store. Ev.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-e2e82202-1191-c883-193c-54248306695a\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><em>Please read the following scenario:<\/em>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Jeff works the night shift at a 24\/7 convenience store. Every day at 7am the owner of the store, Jeff&#39;s boss, takes over for the morning shift. Today, Jeff has an important court appointment at 8am but his boss hasn&#39;t shown up yet and isn&#39;t returning his calls.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Please read the following scenario:\u00a0 \u00a0 Jeff works the night shift at a 24\/7 convenience store. Ev...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-e2e82202-1191-c883-193c-54248306695a\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><em>Please read the following scenario:<\/em>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Daniel is the ring bearer at his sister&rsquo;s wedding. 10 minutes into the ceremony, he reaches into his pocket but the ring isn&rsquo;t there. He realizes he left it on the seat next to him in the taxi.<\/span><\/span><\/p>","DataExportTag":"C1-Scenario9","QuestionID":"QID758"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7WAUs8h39ApcuMe","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID759","SecondaryAttribute":"In this situation, what are some things you believe Jeff could do? Please list 5.","Tertiar